## The API in this portal

Google has shut down the Cloud Endpoints developer portal, so this portal takes its place:

- `catalog-info.yaml` registers an API entity next to the component. Its definition is read from `${{ values.grpcSpec if grpc else values.openApiSpec }}` on the main branch, so the API page shows what is deployed.
- Consumers are managed in Terraform. A principal in the `api_consumers` variable gets the Service Consumer role on the Endpoints service and can then enable the API in its own project{% if apiKey %} and create API keys for it{% endif %}.
{%- endif %}

